<title>USA: Provident finishes buying Paul Revere.</title>
<headline>Provident finishes buying Paul Revere.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provident Cos Inc said Thursday it completed its acquisition of Paul Revere Corp .</p>
<p>Under terms of the transaction, Paul Revere becomes a wholly owned subsidiary of Provident. Paul Revere's public shareholders may elect to receive for each Paul Revere share either $26.00, or a combination of $20.00 in cash and 0.177 shares of Provident common stock, or 0.767 shares of Provident common stock.</p>
</text>
